cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  AI-related private qualifications in South Korea:
  2024 examination records
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it as below.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: International AI Practitioner Qualification Board
    website: https://iapqb.org
    country: KR
abstract: >-
  Candidate and pass counts for AI-related private qualifications in
  South Korea in 2024, aggregated per qualification from the official
  KRIVET release (183,147 rows, 23,068 registration numbers). Of 107
  qualifications matched on name, 50 held an examination with at least
  one candidate, 5 filed a nil return, and 52 filed nothing. Across the
  50, there were 25,416 candidates and 15,708 passes, and 20
  qualifications passed every candidate who sat. No issuing body in this
  market published its own pass rate at the time of compilation; the
  rates here are computed from the raw government file. The aggregation
  script is included so that every figure can be reproduced from the
  public source.
keywords:
  - AI literacy
  - artificial intelligence
  - certification
  - private qualifications
  - pass rate
  - South Korea
  - open data
repository-code: https://github.com/iapqb/iapqb.github.io
url: https://iapqb.org
date-released: '2026-08-12'
version: '1.0'
license: CC-BY-4.0
